@startuml
title Data Ingestion Process (Unified Flow)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam style strictuml

actor "User / System Trigger\n(S3 Event)" as Trigger
participant "Data Parser" as Parser
participant "Backend API" as API
database "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

box "Ingestion Service" #F9F9F9
    participant Parser
    participant API
end box

Trigger -> Parser : Incoming CSV/JSON Stream
activate Parser

Parser -> Parser : Read Input Stream
Parser --> API : Parsed Records
activate API
deactivate Parser

API -> API : Validate Schema & Process
note right: Check columns, types, and logic

API -> DB : Store Formatted Data
activate DB
DB --> API : Success
deactivate DB

API --> Trigger : Confirmation Response
deactivate API

@enduml
